Cell["\<\
The bold number is the degeneracy; inside the square brackets are the quantum \
numbers: red is for m (gl(1) in osp(2|2)), while blue is for r (outer \
automorphism) and black is for R (R-filtration).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.801917426301194*^9, 3.8019175186351423`*^9}, {
   3.814859728442419*^9, 3.81485976771483*^9}, 3.817013787439929*^9, 
   3.821883238383274*^9},ExpressionUUID->"0d711597-64df-4473-a560-\
ee9fe587f413"],

