f64d487eba9e"],

Cell["\<\
In this section we set up certain calculational parameters to ease the \
character calculation later on. This is especially important if the faster \
calculation (fcal) option has been ticked in the settings.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8170121283902493`*^9, 3.817012210521497*^9}, 
   3.8219637213518963`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"0202567c-bfbe-49be-9114-\
7ee8d7853e05"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"mparam", "=", 
